donyati-pstack
==============

This plugin adapts a subset of the `pstack` skill set.

Upstream project:  https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack
Upstream author:   Lauren Tan (poteto)
Upstream license:  MIT
Upstream commit:   60c641e4fad674784b30abcf9f8915dea39df38d (2026-08-18)
Vendored on:       2026-08-19

Of the 44 upstream skills, 14 are vendored here. The rest were excluded because they
depend on Graphite, the GitHub API, Cursor-only host features, or a multi-model panel
whose model identifiers do not resolve in Claude Code. See README.md for the full list
and the reasoning.

Four skills were modified from upstream:

  skills/unslop/SKILL.md
    Added `disable-model-invocation: true` and a scoping note. Upstream ships
    `description: Cut AI tells from any writing. Must always apply.` with no guard, which
    fires on nearly every turn and collides with the workspace rule routing client-facing
    prose to `avoid-ai-writing`.

  skills/blast-radius/SKILL.md
    Removed references to `how`, `why`, and `arena`, none of which are vendored here.
    Repointed PR archaeology at `az repos pr` (Azure DevOps, not GitHub) and repointed
    multi-model review at `dispatch codex|gemini` rather than an in-harness model panel.

  skills/create-verification-skill/SKILL.md
    Output path changed from `.cursor/skills/verify-<app>/` to `.claude/skills/verify-<app>/`.

  skills/show-me-your-work/SKILL.md
    Transcript path changed from Cursor's `agent-transcripts/` layout to
    `~/.claude/projects/<workspace-slug>/`.

All other vendored files are unmodified from upstream.

